# MAGIC Columnns *passenger_count* and *DOLocationID* are the only columns containing some missing values. The nulls in both columns are a small fraction of the records. Considering quality checks that will be implemented in the bronze layer, warn will be preferred ahead of fail and drop to avoid skewing the dataset that would inform the company on spatial demand, temporal trends, and revenue optimization. However for capacity planning, statistical method should be applied to account for nulls in the passenger_count column. This can be considered in the silver or gold layer.

